.TH dir 1 (date) "GNU coreutils (unreleased)"
.SH NAME
dir \- list directory contents
.SH Synopsis
.SY dir
.RI [ OPTION \~.\|.\|.\&]
.RI [ FILE \~.\|.\|.\&]
.YS
.SH Description
.B dir
is equivalent to
.IR ls\~\-C\~\-b .
.P
See
.BR ls (1).
